              "id": "1768465391064_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.lastResponse}}`\n- **Inbound Context Details:** `{{$context.$variables.contextDetails}}`\n- **Action Details:** `{{$context.$variables.actionDetails}}`\n- **Communication Details:** `{{$context.$variables.communicationDetails}}`\n- **Login user (email sender):** `{{$context.$user.$name}}`\n- **current date:** `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`\n---\n### **Tasks**\n0. use current date as today date\n1. **Display the Query Response based on User Request:**\n    - Show a summary at the top, highlighting the most relevant context from Query Response for the user request.\n    - Do **not** include JSON output, action details, actionable insights, or priority actions in the user-facing response text.\n    - Do **not** display `personId` or `assignmentId` in the response text.\n    - Do **not** display `Repcounts' directly, show headcounts as Directs and Total.\n       Repcounts: x - y in response indicate that employee has x and y number of heacounts as Directs and Total.\n\n2.  MUST always generate 3 low priority actionable insights (ranked by priority, relevance) in below sample format for Scenerio 1, Scenerio 2, Scenerio 3\n{\"title\":\"Scenerio 1\",\"shortDescription\":\"select scenerio 1 shown above.\",\"actionText\":\"Scenerio 1\",\"priority\":false,\"followUpCommand\":\"ora.Invoke(\\\"sendAgentCmd\\\", \\\"<payload>\\\")\"}\npayload format is `{\"actionCode\": \"modelingOption-Scenerio1\"}`\n- must include \"sendAgentCmd\" for the followUpCommand.\n\n---\n**User Request:**  \nCurrent prompt: `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`  \nChat history: `{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}`"
            }
          ],
