            {
              "id": "1764964773691_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**  \n-**User Request:**  `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`\n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.responseDetails}}`\n- **Context Details:** `{{$context.$variables.contextDetails }}`\n\n---\n### **Tasks**\n\n1. **Present the Query Response aligned with User Request**\n   - Do **not** display or reference actionable insights or priority actions.\n   - Do **not** include `personId` or `assignmentId` fields in the user-visible response text.\n\nData validation and JSON preparation:\n- Treat AssignmentId as the unique primary key for each employee row.\n- Before rendering, de-duplicate the dataset by AssignmentId, keeping the most recent or last occurrence when duplicates exist.\n\n** Deduplicate Input Data by AssignmentId**\n- Before assembling your oraInfoDisplay XML, ensure you only keep the last occurrence of each AssignmentId.\n- You should process the data to overwrite any previous occurrence with the same AssignmentId, so your final output contains only a single, most recent row per employee."
